      "data": {
        "bold": false,
        "text": "Trailer + Formats\n\nUpload a recording and get a short teaser in three social formats. Transcribe reads the words, the Trailer Plan node (Cloud) picks the strongest moments and joins them with crossfades into one 20–40 second trailer, and Apply Cut renders it. Combine Videos puts your optional intro card in front, and the three format nodes deliver it as a 9:16 story or reel, a 1:1 square post and a 4:5 portrait post.\n\nDrop your recording on Episode Recording, then Run down the chain.",
