      "data": {
        "bold": false,
        "text": "Three formats\n\nEach format node fits the trailer to its platform size. They pad (the whole picture, with bars) rather than crop, because a centre crop of a two-person wide shot cuts a speaker off. For a single speaker centred in frame, switch a node's method to Crop to fill the frame.\n\nDelete any format you do not need, or add another Social Media Format node for a different platform.",
